\**{c=red:Note:}** This quest cannot be started if you have the quest {q:The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown}, {q:As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves}, {q:Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate}, {q:Rock Racketeer|Rock Racketeer|Rock Racketeer}, or {M:Windurst Mission 2-1|Windurst Mission 2-1|Lost for Words} active. {br} **Optional**: Activate the {p:Records of Eminence} 15th Vana'versary I objective __The Star of Tenshodo (W)__ for sparks and experience.
=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {p:Nanaa Mihgo} multiple times till the Quest is flagged.
** If done as a level 40+ {p:Thief}, it will potentially begin the Quests {q:The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown|The Tenshodo Showdown} (THF AF 1), {q:As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves|As Thick as Thieves} (THF AF 2) and/or {q:Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate|Hitting the Marquisate} (THF AF 3). You will need to finish these first to flag this Quest.
** **(Optional):** Speak to {n:Cha Lebagta}.
* You will have to obtain 4 {@i:Yagudo Necklace|498} {i:Yagudo Necklaces|Yagudo Necklace|498}.
** They can be purchased from the {z:Auction House}. ({@g:Auction House} > Others > Beast-made)
** Alternatively, they can be obtained by killing {m:Yagudos|Yagudo} (**{p:VC|Very Common (24% or higher)}**) in {z:Tahrongi Canyon} or {z:Giddeus}.
* Trade {p:Nanaa Mihgo} the Necklaces to complete the Quest.

=2 Notes
* Completing this Quest raises your fame in {z:Norg}.
** It takes 53 completions of this Quest to raise your {z:Norg} fame to level 4, which is enough to start {q:The Sahagin's Stash|The Sahagin's Stash|The Sahagin's Stash} ({p:Utsusemi: Ichi}) and {q:Trial by Water|Trial by Water|Trial by Water}.
* The completion of this Quest is one of the requirements to obtain {p:Nanaa Mihgo's Trust|BGWiki:Trusts}.

